      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Watching the queue",
      "prov:value": "**The queue path is read from the declaration, never written down.** It is\n`uploads/` relative to the *instance*, which is not where a repository-relative\nconsumer would look — the segment that caused a live 404, recorded in\n`content-acquisition`. `queueRepoRelative` in `scripts/upload-url.ts` is the one\nplace that arithmetic lives."
    }
  ]
